{"id":"6046552157f71d9c","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-projective-variety.md","title":"Projective Variety","display":"df-projective-variety — Projective Variety","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-projective-variety","aliases":["58-df-projective-variety","Projective Variety"],"display":"df-projective-variety — Projective Variety","depends_on":["[[58-df-projective-space]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-polynomial]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-projective-variety"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-projective-variety</span><span>Projective Variety</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-projective-variety — Projective Variety"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"24c725a359792259\" href=\"?note=24c725a359792259\" title=\"58-df-projective-space\">58-df-projective-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" href=\"?note=ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" title=\"58-df-polynomial\">58-df-polynomial</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,X,\\tau_Z\\in V\">\\(P,X,\\tau_Z\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S(P,k,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S(P,k,n)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S(E,k,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S(E,k,n)\\)</span> are supplied by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"24c725a359792259\" href=\"?note=24c725a359792259\" title=\"58-df-projective-space\">58-df-projective-space</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\">\\(\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\)</span> fixes the coefficient structure used by every polynomial</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\\)</span> are used with their exact ring-explicit signatures from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" href=\"?note=ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" title=\"58-df-polynomial\">58-df-polynomial</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomogeneousPolynomial}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HomogeneousPolynomial}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveZeroLocus}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveZeroLocus}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveZariskiTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveZariskiTopology}_S\\)</span> are defined below</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(X;P,k,n,\\tau_Z)\">\\(\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(X;P,k,n,\\tau_Z)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}homogeneous\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HomogeneousPolynomial}_S(f,d;k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,m)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nd\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(f,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,m)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;\\left(f(\\alpha)\\neq0_k\\to\\sum_{i&lt;m}\\alpha(i)=d\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}homogeneous\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HomogeneousPolynomial}_S(f,d;k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,m)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nd\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(f,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,m)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;\\left(f(\\alpha)\\neq0_k\\to\\sum_{i&lt;m}\\alpha(i)=d\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}zero\\text{-}locus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveZeroLocus}_S(Z,F;P,E,k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S(E,k,n)\n\\land P=\\{[x]_E:x\\in k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\exists d\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{HomogeneousPolynomial}_S(f,d;k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,n+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land Z=\\Bigl\\{u\\in P:\\exists x\\in k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl(\nu=[x]_E\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\n(0_k,f,x,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,n+1)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}zero\\text{-}locus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveZeroLocus}_S(Z,F;P,E,k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S(E,k,n)\n\\land P=\\{[x]_E:x\\in k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\exists d\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{HomogeneousPolynomial}_S(f,d;k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,n+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land Z=\\Bigl\\{u\\in P:\\exists x\\in k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl(\nu=[x]_E\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\n(0_k,f,x,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,n+1)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}zariski\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveZariskiTopology}_S(\\tau_Z;P,k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S(P,k,n)\n\\land\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S(E,k,n)\n\\land P=\\{[x]_E:x\\in k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{41mm}\\land\\tau_Z=\\{P\\setminus Z:\\exists F\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveZeroLocus}_S(Z,F;P,E,k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}zariski\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveZariskiTopology}_S(\\tau_Z;P,k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S(P,k,n)\n\\land\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S(E,k,n)\n\\land P=\\{[x]_E:x\\in k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{41mm}\\land\\tau_Z=\\{P\\setminus Z:\\exists F\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveZeroLocus}_S(Z,F;P,E,k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(X;P,k,n,\\tau_Z)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveZariskiTopology}_S(\\tau_Z;P,k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(P,\\tau_Z)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\varnothing\\neq X\\subseteq P\\land P\\setminus X\\in\\tau_Z\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall F,G\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exists U,V\\in\\tau_Z\\;(X\\setminus F=U\\cap X\\land X\\setminus G=V\\cap X)\n\\land X=F\\cup G\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{65mm}\\to X=F\\lor X=G\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(X;P,k,n,\\tau_Z)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveZariskiTopology}_S(\\tau_Z;P,k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(P,\\tau_Z)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\varnothing\\neq X\\subseteq P\\land P\\setminus X\\in\\tau_Z\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall F,G\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exists U,V\\in\\tau_Z\\;(X\\setminus F=U\\cap X\\land X\\setminus G=V\\cap X)\n\\land X=F\\cup G\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{65mm}\\to X=F\\lor X=G\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The topology parameter is now constrained to be the projective Zariski topology generated by common zero loci of homogeneous polynomials; an arbitrary topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> no longer qualifies.</li>\n<li>Algebraic irreducibility is expressed as topological irreducibility in that sourced topology.</li>\n<li>Segre: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{P}^n \\times \\mathbb{P}^m\">\\(\\mathbb{P}^n \\times \\mathbb{P}^m\\)</span> embedded via Segre; products are projective</li>\n<li>Proj construction: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proj} S^\\bullet L\">\\(\\operatorname{Proj} S^\\bullet L\\)</span> gives projective scheme from graded algebra</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hartshorne, Algebraic Geometry</li>\n<li>Harris, Algebraic Geometry</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-projective-space","status":"resolved","id":"24c725a359792259","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-projective-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-polynomial]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-projective-space","status":"resolved","id":"24c725a359792259","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S(P,k,n)$ and $\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S(E,k,n)$ are supplied by [[58-df-projective-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-polynomial","status":"resolved","id":"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S$ and $\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S$ are used with their exact ring-explicit signatures from [[58-df-polynomial]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"P,X,\\tau_Z\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S(P,k,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S(E,k,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HomogeneousPolynomial}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProjectiveZeroLocus}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProjectiveZariskiTopology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(X;P,k,n,\\tau_Z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}homogeneous\\text{-}polynomial}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HomogeneousPolynomial}_S(f,d;k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,m)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nd\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(f,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,m)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;\\left(f(\\alpha)\\neq0_k\\to\\sum_{i<m}\\alpha(i)=d\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}zero\\text{-}locus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveZeroLocus}_S(Z,F;P,E,k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S(E,k,n)\n\\land P=\\{[x]_E:x\\in k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\exists d\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{HomogeneousPolynomial}_S(f,d;k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,n+1)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land Z=\\Bigl\\{u\\in P:\\exists x\\in k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl(\nu=[x]_E\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\n(0_k,f,x,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,n+1)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}zariski\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveZariskiTopology}_S(\\tau_Z;P,k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveSpace}_S(P,k,n)\n\\land\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ScalarEquivalenceRelation}_S(E,k,n)\n\\land P=\\{[x]_E:x\\in k^{n+1}\\setminus\\{0\\}\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{41mm}\\land\\tau_Z=\\{P\\setminus Z:\\exists F\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveZeroLocus}_S(Z,F;P,E,k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projective\\text{-}variety}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(X;P,k,n,\\tau_Z)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveZariskiTopology}_S(\\tau_Z;P,k,n,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\n\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(P,\\tau_Z)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\varnothing\\neq X\\subseteq P\\land P\\setminus X\\in\\tau_Z\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall F,G\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exists U,V\\in\\tau_Z\\;(X\\setminus F=U\\cap X\\land X\\setminus G=V\\cap X)\n\\land X=F\\cup G\\\\\n&\\hspace{65mm}\\to X=F\\lor X=G\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{P}^n \\times \\mathbb{P}^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Proj} S^\\bullet L","display":false}],"bytes":3676,"backlinks":[{"id":"03dcbc472c7a5883","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bf97099d9a48be46","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"41289d25523036d5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(X;P_X,k,n_X,\\tau_X)$ (projective-variety predicate with its ambient projective data, see [[58-df-projective-variety]])"},{"id":"71c5426cce937ee1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(C;P,k,n,\\tau_Z)$ (exact irreducible projective-variety predicate, see [[58-df-projective-variety]])"},{"id":"bf0ad86f0f4cd75f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(\\,\\cdot\\,;\\,\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot):V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch20/58-df-projective-variety.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1006","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-projective-variety.md|58-df-projective-variety]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["24c725a359792259","815e63e5071e7b58","ab5e359a8ea0dcb4"]}